{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VAJhVYb7AbhBnQ5J8npWEq","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The proposal is KIP-1262, “Enable auto-formatting directories”, which removes the requirement for brokers and observer controllers to run `kafka-storage format` before starting Kafka, and the new metadata record `ClusterIdRecord` defines its `clusterId` field as type **UUID**.  \\\\n\\\\n- 2026-01-06T13:18:38.000000Z - mail:8e958fd66bd3b2546376c7fe - Kevin Wu announces KIP-1262, stating it “proposes removing the formatting requirement for brokers and observer controllers.”  \\\\n- 2026-02-18T16:49:06.000000Z - mail:2d2cdd9e66fc4758f70d714c - Kevin Wu updates the KIP record schema for `ClusterIdRecord`, noting the decision to use a **UUID** type for the `clusterId` field.  \\\\n\\\\nNo conflicting or missing information was found.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"mail:2d2cdd9e66fc4758f70d714c\\\",\\\"mail:8e958fd66bd3b2546376c7fe\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":51.509,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":23,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.00740241,\\\"input_tokens\\\":231327,\\\"output_tokens\\\":14481}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"724d5029-14b0-49e5-b521-764c3d6de8d8","uuid":"658aad88-e256-4682-893b-ff0a15be895a","timestamp":"2026-09-29T14:24:59.771Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"The proposal is KIP-1262, “Enable auto-formatting directories”, which removes the requirement for brokers and observer controllers to run `kafka-storage format` before starting Kafka, and the new metadata record `ClusterIdRecord` defines its `clusterId` field as type **UUID**.  \\\\n\\\\n- 2026-01-06T13:18:38.000000Z - mail:8e958fd66bd3b2546376c7fe - Kevin Wu announces KIP-1262, stating it “proposes removing the formatting requirement for brokers and observer controllers.”  \\\\n- 2026-02-18T16:49:06.000000Z - mail:2d2cdd9e66fc4758f70d714c - Kevin Wu updates the KIP record schema for `ClusterIdRecord`, noting the decision to use a **UUID** type for the `clusterId` field.  \\\\n\\\\nNo conflicting or missing information was found.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"mail:2d2cdd9e66fc4758f70d714c\\\",\\\"mail:8e958fd66bd3b2546376c7fe\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":51.509,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":23,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":null,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.00740241,\\\"input_tokens\\\":231327,\\\"output_tokens\\\":14481}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"The proposal is KIP-1262, “Enable auto-formatting directories”, which removes the requirement for brokers and observer controllers to run `kafka-storage format` before starting Kafka, and the new metadata record `ClusterIdRecord` defines its `clusterId` field as type **UUID**.  \\n\\n- 2026-01-06T13:18:38.000000Z - mail:8e958fd66bd3b2546376c7fe - Kevin Wu announces KIP-1262, stating it “proposes removing the formatting requirement for brokers and observer controllers.”  \\n- 2026-02-18T16:49:06.000000Z - mail:2d2cdd9e66fc4758f70d714c - Kevin Wu updates the KIP record schema for `ClusterIdRecord`, noting the decision to use a **UUID** type for the `clusterId` field.  \\n\\nNo conflicting or missing information was found.\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"mail:2d2cdd9e66fc4758f70d714c\",\"mail:8e958fd66bd3b2546376c7fe\"],\"seconds\":51.509,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":23,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":null,\"cache_write_tokens\":null,\"cost_usd\":0.00740241,\"input_tokens\":231327,\"output_tokens\":14481}}"}}}
